# Whitelist: publish only hand-written sources and project definition
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README*
!*.v
!*.sv
!*.vh
!*.svh
!*.vhd
!*.mem
!*.coe
!*.xdc
!*.tcl
!*.xci
!*.bd
!*.xpr
!*.py
# never publish Vivado-generated folders (overrides the directory re-include above)
**/*.cache/
**/*.hw/
**/*.ip_user_files/
**/*.sim/
**/*.gen/
**/*.runs/
**/.Xil/